      "content": "LONDON ROAD 1. 5252                                                   (South Side)                                                   Bourne End                                                   Bourne End Farmhouse TL 0206 5/113 II 2. C17.  Colour washed roughcast, old tiled roof with 3 diagonally set shafts to chimneystack.  Timber frame visible in 2 east gables.  2 storeys, modern casement windows.  Cross gable to road. Listing NGR: TL0223406261"
